{
  "title": "示例商城 · 高可用实验",
  "uid": "mall-ha-experiments",
  "description": "高可用实验（experiments/）配套面板：入口限流、mall-app 线程与连接池、服务间调用的超时 / 熔断 / 舱壁 / 重试、下游与注入的故障、多实例滚动重启。部分面板需要实验的 common.properties 打开的指标（Tomcat MBean、耗时直方图）",
  "tags": [
    "mall",
    "ha",
    "experiment"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "数据源",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": ""
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "mall-app 实例",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(jvm_info{application=\"mall-app\"}, instance)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(jvm_info{application=\"mall-app\"}, instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "入口：网关",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "网关每秒请求（按状态码）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"mall-gateway\",uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "5xx 是网关自己给出的失败（504 = 后端 3 秒没回、503 = 没有可用实例、500 = 连不上实例），429 是限流"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "网关限流（按路由的总量限流 / 按用户限流）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(gateway_route_limited_total{application=\"mall-gateway\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "总量限流 {{route}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"mall-gateway\",status=\"429\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "全部 429"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "实验 D：mall.gateway.route-limits 打开后，超过阈值的匿名请求在网关直接 429"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "mall-app（实例：$instance）",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "每秒请求（按接口与状态码）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (method, uri, status) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\",uri=~\"/api/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{uri}} {{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "P99 耗时（按接口）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, method, uri) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_bucket{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\",uri=~\"/api/.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{uri}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "需要 management.metrics.distribution.percentiles-histogram.http.server.requests=true（实验的 common.properties 已打开），否则只有 800ms 一个桶"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tomcat 线程",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (tomcat_threads_busy_threads{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "忙 {{instance}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (instance) (tomcat_threads_config_max_threads{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "上限 {{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "需要 server.tomcat.mbeanregistry.enabled=true（实验的 common.properties 已打开）。忙线程贴着上限 = 新请求在排队"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "数据库连接池（HikariCP）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (hikaricp_connections_active{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "使用中 {{instance}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (instance) (hikaricp_connections_pending{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "等连接 {{instance}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (instance) (hikaricp_connections_max{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "上限 {{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "mall-app → 库存 / 支付（服务间调用的保护）",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "每秒下游调用（按接口与结果）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (uri, outcome) (rate(http_client_requests_seconds_count{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\",uri=~\"/internal/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{uri}} {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "客户端视角：每一次尝试都算，重试也算"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "下游调用耗时（平均 / 最大）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (uri) (rate(http_client_requests_seconds_sum{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\",uri=~\"/internal/.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum by (uri) (rate(http_client_requests_seconds_count{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\",uri=~\"/internal/.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "平均 {{uri}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (uri) (http_client_requests_seconds_max{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\",uri=~\"/internal/.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "最大 {{uri}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "客户端耗时含「等连接池」；和下游服务端耗时对比，差出来的就是排队等连接的时间"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "熔断器状态（打开 / 半开）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (name, state) (resilience4j_circuitbreaker_state{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\",state=~\"open|half_open|forced_open\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}} {{state}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "1 = 处于该状态"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "熔断器失败率 / 慢调用率",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (name) (resilience4j_circuitbreaker_failure_rate{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "失败率 {{name}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (name) (resilience4j_circuitbreaker_slow_call_rate{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "慢调用率 {{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "-1 表示窗口内调用数还不到 minimum-number-of-calls，熔断器还没开始统计"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "熔断拒绝与舱壁余量",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 43,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (name) (rate(resilience4j_circuitbreaker_not_permitted_calls_total{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "熔断拒绝/秒 {{name}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "min by (name) (resilience4j_bulkhead_available_concurrent_calls{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"})",
          "legendFormat": "舱壁剩余许可 {{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "只读查询的重试",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 43,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (method) (rate(remote_retryable_failures_total{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "失败的尝试/秒 {{method}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (method) (rate(remote_retryable_exhausted_total{application=\"mall-app\",instance=~\"$instance\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "重试用完放弃/秒 {{method}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "每一次失败的尝试都算（含第一次），和下游收到的请求数一起看放大倍数"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "库存服务 / 支付服务",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 51,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "下游服务每秒请求（按接口与状态码）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 52,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (application, uri, status) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=~\"inventory-service|payment-service\",uri=~\"/internal/(inventory|payments).*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}} {{uri}} {{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "服务端视角：实际到达的请求数，含重试"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "支付查询放大倍数",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 52,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"payment-service\",uri=\"/internal/payments/{orderNo}\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{application=\"mall-app\",uri=\"/api/orders/{orderNo}/payment\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "支付服务收到 / mall-app 收到"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "实验 B：mall-app 每收到 1 次查询，支付服务收到几次。客户端（App）的重试另算，见压测报告"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "注入的故障：排队与在途",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 60,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (application, rule) (demo_fault_waiting)",
          "legendFormat": "排队 {{application}} {{rule}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (application, rule) (demo_fault_inflight)",
          "legendFormat": "在途 {{application}} {{rule}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "description": "demo profile 的故障注入（/internal/demo/faults）。排队数持续上涨说明到达速率超过了模拟的容量"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "下游 Tomcat 线程",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 60,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
